   116→ * The entry point for inverse FFT over field elements.
   117→ *
   118→ * @param[out]  out The results, length `n`
   119→ * @param[in]   in  The input data, length `n`
   120→ * @param[in]   n   Length of the arrays
   121→ * @param[in]   s   The trusted setup
   122→ *
   123→ * @remark Will do nothing if given a zero length array.
   124→ * @remark The array lengths must be a power of two.
   125→ * @remark Use fr_fft() for forward transformation.
   126→ */
