   159→ * @param[in]   stride          The input data stride
   160→ * @param[in]   roots           Roots of unity, length `n * roots_stride`
   161→ * @param[in]   roots_stride    The stride interval among the roots of unity
   162→ * @param[in]   n               Length of the FFT, must be a power of two
