   287→ * @param[out]  out The results, length `n`
   288→ * @param[in]   in  The input data, length `n`
   289→ * @param[in]   n   Length of the arrays
   290→ * @param[in]   s   The trusted setup
   291→ *
   292→ * @remark Will do nothing if given a zero length array.
   293→ * @remark The coset shift factor is RECOVERY_SHIFT_FACTOR. In this function we use its inverse to
   294→ * implement the IFFT.
